脚本或样式来生成最终效果通常不会生效。"},"176":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#须知事项","content":"由于 satori 并不完整地应用组件级样式，单纯依靠 class 引入的样式通常不可预期。satori 对部分 Tailwind CSS 类有内置支持，但支持范围有限且可能随版本变化，使用前请务必自行测试。如果你在 class 中使用 Tailwind，请在目标环境中验证样式是否生效。"},"177":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#须知事项","content":"要保证样式在图片中生效，推荐将关键样式写为内联样式（例如 style=\"...\"），或者在渲染前把模板预渲染为包含最终样式的静态 HTML 再交给 satori。可以参考 satori 的 CSS 支持列表来确认哪些 CSS 属性被支持"},"178":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#须知事项","content":"title: satori 支持的 CSS 列表（参考）"},"179":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#须知事项","content":"https://github.com/vercel/satori?tab=readme-ov-file#css"},"180":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#使用方法","content":"在 @function/genImg.ts 中 我们包装了一个 generateImage 方法用于图片生成"},"181":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#使用方法","content":"下面是 generateImage 方法的类型表，使用项目内置的 TypeTable 组件展示参数说明与返回值："},"182":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#使用方法","content":"type: {\n  \"options\": {\n    description: \"图片生成选项对象\",\n    type: <code>{`{ width: number | 'auto'; height: number | 'auto'; fonts?: FontOptions[]; debug?: boolean; quality?: number; imgname?: string; format?: 'png' | 'jpg' | 'jpeg'; jpegQuality?: number }`}</code>,\n    parameters: [\n      { name: 'width', description: <span>图片宽度，数字或字符串 <code>\"auto\"</code></span> },\n      { name: 'height', description: <span>图片高度，数字或字符串 <code>\"auto\"</code></span> },\n      { name: 'fonts', description: <sp